# This package ships C++ headers only (inst/include/). There is no R-level API
# and no compiled code, so nothing is exported and no shared library is loaded.
# Other packages consume it with `LinkingTo: leaf` in their DESCRIPTION.
#
# See PLAN.md ("Give it an R interface") for the RcppR6 bindings that would put
# leaf::Leaf in front of R users directly.
